# apps/api — backend

NestJS 11 ESM API (`"type": "module"`). Relative imports use **`.js` suffixes**. Consumers of queued work live in `apps/worker` — API only **enqueues**.

## Modular architecture

Every feature folder follows:

```
feature/
  feature.module.ts
  feature.controller.ts   # routes, decorators, DTO binding only
  feature.service.ts      # authz + domain orchestration
  feature.repository.ts   # Prisma queries
  dto/*.dto.ts
  *.spec.ts               # colocated
```

- Controllers return service results — **no Prisma in controllers**.
- Wire in `*.module.ts`; import sibling modules when needed; export services used elsewhere.
- Global stack in `app.module.ts`: `ConfigModule` (root env + `validateEnv`), `PrismaModule`, `CommonModule`, `StorageModule`, `JobsModule`, `AuthModule`.
- Global providers: `GlobalExceptionFilter`, `ResponseTransformInterceptor`, `LoggingInterceptor`.
- Guard order (`APP_GUARD`): `ThrottlerGuard` → `ClerkAuthGuard` → `PermissionsGuard` → `TenantGuard`.

## Auth (Clerk + Nest RBAC)

```ts
@Public()                                      // skip ClerkAuthGuard
@RequirePermission(PERMISSIONS.SURVEY_VIEW)    // AND; or @RequireAnyPermission
@CurrentUser() user: AuthenticatedUser
```

- `@clerk/backend` verifies Bearer JWT; guard upserts local `User` and attaches `request.user`.
- Permissions catalog: `common/constants/permissions.ts` (`survey:view`, `etl:manage`, …).
- TenantGuard scopes geo IDs in body/query/params via `canAccessTenant` — do not trust client geo alone.
- Dev only: `ALLOW_DEV_AUTH=true` → `Bearer dev` / `Bearer dev:<clerkUserId>`.

## Prisma (`@workspace/database`)

```ts
// Inject PrismaService — use .db (preferred)
constructor(private readonly prisma: PrismaService) {}
await this.prisma.db.floor.findMany({ where, skip, take })

import type { Prisma } from "@workspace/database"
import { UsageFactor } from "@workspace/database"
```

- `@Global()` `PrismaModule` — never `new PrismaClient()` in features.
- Client factory lives in the package (`createPrismaClient`); schema at `packages/database/prisma/schema.prisma`.
- Repos throw `NotFoundException`; use `getSkipTake` / `toPaginatedResult` / `buildOrderBy` / `buildTenantWhere`.
- Shared domain rules: `@workspace/validation` inside repositories/services when applicable.

## Redis / BullMQ (`@workspace/jobs`)

- Register queues via `JobsModule` (`BullModule.forRootAsync` + `REDIS_URL`; fail fast if missing).
- **Always** import names/payloads from `@workspace/jobs`:

```ts
import { JOB_QUEUE_NAMES, JOB_NAMES, type ImportJobPayload } from "@workspace/jobs"

await this.jobsService.enqueueImport(payload) // prefer JobsService wrappers
// raw: queue.add(JOB_NAMES.processImport, payload, { jobId })
```

Queues: `imports`, `exports`, `storage-cleanup`, `image-migration`, `etl-survey-import`, `etl-image-download`, `etl-image-upload`, `etl-validation`, `etl-retry`, `etl-report`.

- Default job opts: 3 attempts, exponential backoff, bounded `removeOnComplete`/`removeOnFail`.
- Features call `JobsService` — do not `@InjectQueue` from random feature modules unless extending jobs infrastructure.
- Worker registers the **same** queue names and processes with `@Processor(JOB_QUEUE_NAMES.*)`.

## MinIO / S3 storage & presigned URLs

- Inject `StorageService` (facade over `STORAGE_SERVICE`). Provider: `STORAGE_PROVIDER=minio` → MinIO; else AWS S3.
- Object keys under `uploads/`, `imports/`, or `exports/` only, e.g.  
  `uploads/{stateId}/{districtId}/{ulbId}/{wardId}/survey/{surveyId}/{uuid}.ext`
- Presign via facade (default TTL **900s**):

```ts
await this.storage.getPresignedUploadUrl(key, mimeType, 900)
await this.storage.getPresignedDownloadUrl(key, 900) // photos often 3600
```

- Download signing prefers `MINIO_PUBLIC_URL` / public endpoint so browsers never hit internal `minio:9000`.
- ACL private; uploads validate image MIME (jpeg/png/webp) + size; return checksum/etag.
- Do not call `@aws-sdk/s3-request-presigner` directly from feature services — go through `StorageService`.

## DTOs & responses

- Global `ValidationPipe`: `whitelist`, `transform`, `forbidNonWhitelisted`, `enableImplicitConversion`.
- DTOs: `class-validator` + `@ApiProperty` / `@ApiPropertyOptional`; Prisma enums via `@IsEnum(...)`.
- Query numbers: `@Type(() => Number)` + `@IsInt`/`@IsNumber`. Updates: `PartialType(CreateXDto)`.
- List queries: extend/reuse `PaginationQueryDto` (`page`, `limit` 1–100, `sortBy`, `sortOrder`, `search`).
- API envelope (interceptor): `{ success, message, data, errors, timestamp, path, statusCode }`.

## Conventions

- Swagger: `@ApiTags`, `@ApiBearerAuth`; docs at `/docs` when enabled.
- Throttle: 120 req / 60s global.
- Map Prisma `P2002` → 409 via `GlobalExceptionFilter` (do not swallow unique violations).
- Config from monorepo root env files (`config/env-files.ts` + `env.validation.ts`).
